    "detailed_description": "Manor Mania is a Randomized Metroidvania game on a smaller scale with more focus on replayability. Explore a handcrafted map, find and equip Power Ups &amp; Items to defeat the many enemies &amp; bosses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 7 unique Power Ups to discover, with each one unlocking different routes to explore throughout the manor. The randomized order of these Power Ups, alongside the random loot, will ensure that each run is quite varied.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 12 total equippable slots, which include a Main Weapon, a Ranged Weapon, 8 armor slots, and 2 Trinket slots(DAM &amp; SYN). Items are randomly dropped from enemies, bosses, &amp; chest, These include 7 Weapon varieties, each with its own evolved form, 8 different Armor sets, and 16 unique trinket items. All of these items can be equipped to make for powerful build &quot;combos&quot; to overcome the ever increasing odds.",
    "about_the_game": "Manor Mania is a Randomized Metroidvania game on a smaller scale with more focus on replayability. Explore a handcrafted map, find and equip Power Ups &amp; Items to defeat the many enemies &amp; bosses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 7 unique Power Ups to discover, with each one unlocking different routes to explore throughout the manor. The randomized order of these Power Ups, alongside the random loot, will ensure that each run is quite varied.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 12 total equippable slots, which include a Main Weapon, a Ranged Weapon, 8 armor slots, and 2 Trinket slots(DAM &amp; SYN). Items are randomly dropped from enemies, bosses, &amp; chest, These include 7 Weapon varieties, each with its own evolved form, 8 different Armor sets, and 16 unique trinket items. All of these items can be equipped to make for powerful build &quot;combos&quot; to overcome the ever increasing odds.",
    "short_description": "Manor Mania is a Metrovania Randomizer game nut scaled down in size with more focus on replayability. It has a handcrafted map, equippable gear/weapons, and random Powerups that help you navigate the manor. Many randomized elements ensure variety for each run.",
